WEBVTT

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.530
Wait, Rick! This is a
misunderstanding!

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:39.570
I understand completely.
You're mocking our battles!

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.120
I would never!

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:47.810
No! I saw you hold back on your
attack in your battle with Kai.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:49.020
That was...

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:00.250
Are you saying
I'm wrong?

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.420
I didn't want to
rely on gimmicks.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:05.460
I just wanted fight
him on even ground.

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:10.510
Stupid ideas like that don't
last long in the stadium.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.450
Winning isn't the
be-all-end-all.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:18.240
How you battled, how you
win, and how you lose!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.340
That's what's more important!

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.920
How you lose?

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.840
Yeah. That's better than winning
in a way I can't agree with.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.560
Are you telling me
you'd rather lose?!

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.080
You're darn right I am!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.550
Cut the crap!

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.160
I thought you had
some backbone in you.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.420
Rick...

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.200
I've got nothing left
to say to you.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.620
I'm going solo.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:49.440
Rick...
Why don't you understand?

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.140
I'm looking forward
to your cooking, Mao!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.510
Just make
sure it's edible!

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:10.950
I'm not going to let you eat
it with that attitude, Kiki!

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.950
I'm kidding!
It was a joke!

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:17.290
Your home cooking
is the best!

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:21.000
Rei! Rai! I'm going to
push myself in my cooking!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.690
So do your best in
tomorrow's match!

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:25.050
Yeah, we'll do our best.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.760
We're at one win
and two losses.

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:31.340
Our backs are against the wall,
but we still have a chance to win.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.370
We're gonna win,
no matter what!

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:41.120
But first, we have to eat
and regain our strength.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:45.230
Oh, right. There's something
else I need to buy.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:46.390
Hold these.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.490
Mao! You're going to
get lost on your own!

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.980
I'll be fine!
I'll be right back!

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.780
Uhhh...
And this one goes here...

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.430
And this one here...

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.680
What're you doing, Daichi?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.860
It's not done yet!
Don't look!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.060
What now?

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.280
Now it's all smudged...

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.010
What the hell!

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:20.210
What is this, anyway?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.510
Circle, x, circle,
circle, circle, x?

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:28.460
Daichi was trying to make a
chart of wins and losses, right?

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.400
Allow me.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:32.450
Come on. Say you've
got one if you have it!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:33.760
"You've got one."

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:35.330
Shaddup!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.310
When you count
the number of wins...

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:41.860
Neo-Borg has three wins.
The PPB has two wins.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.020
Barthez Soldat
has one win.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.000
And F-Sangre
has one win...

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.210
Rei's team, Baihuzu
also has one win...

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:52.180
And the BBA
Revolution has two wins...

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:57.970
Every team other than the Barthez Soldat
has a chance to advance to the finals.

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:02.020
So what should we do?

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:05.360
We have two wins,
Kai's team has three...

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.220
Max has... and Rei has...

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:15.460
Whatever! Who cares
about the details?!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.180
We just have to win!
That's all!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.650
Come on now...

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:22.420
Yeah!
Now that I can understand!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.520
We just have to win!
That's all!

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.680
That's it, Daichi!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.160
--We just have to win! That's all!
--We just have to win! That's all!

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:43.760
I'm glad I got these fresh. Perfect for
tonight's dinner and tomorrow's match!

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.440
Is that all you've got?
It's three on one!

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:01.280
Let's wrap this
up, Rock Bison.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.820
Isn't that...

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:13.970
He's--!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:15.800
Hey, you!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:22.090
Where'd Mao run off to?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.600
What if something happens to her while she's out alone?

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:30.250
You're Rick from the
PPB All Starz, right?

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.900
Who the hell are you?

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:35.640
Don't talk to me like that!
I'm Mao from Baihuzu!

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.550
Mao from Baihuzu?

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.570
What are you doing
all the way out here?

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:43.590
That's none of
your business!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.390
You're right.
Suit yourself.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.690
But wow, you're really strong!

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:52.410
So what?

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:56.080
Do you want me to lose
for you in tomorrow's battle?

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:00.120
Rei would get mad if I asked that!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:04.160
But if Rai loses he might
get all gloomy again...

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:07.430
Like "It's all my fault!
It's all my fault!"

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.120
That's a loser's face.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:14.600
Tell him he should quit
Beyblading if he acts like that.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.440
We'll find out who's the
loser in tomorrow's battle.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.920
What'd you say?

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:25.060
And hey, if you had to quit
Beyblading just because of a loss or two,

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:28.050
I would have had
to quit ages ago!

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:33.480
I always lose to Rei and Rai,
because I'm not nearly as good!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:38.180
Why would you keep
Beyblading if you never win?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:41.330
Because it's fun, obviously!

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.440
Fun?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.110
You see,

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:49.900
I have the most fun when
we all Beyblade together.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.770
Hey!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.470
Mao!

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:56.320
It's Rai!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.690
Rai! I'm over here!

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.760
Rai! Rai!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.670
Mao, what are you doing
all the way out here?

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.280
You're...

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.950
What are you
doing with Mao?

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:12.290
Oh, and now
the loser's here?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.260
What?!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:17.680
You should keep an eye on your little
sister if you're so worried about her.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.450
Bastard!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.430
I see one of our members
has been bothering you.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:24.230
Do you need something?

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:29.000
Meeting with an opponent before
a match is just asking for trouble.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:32.980
You're right.
We'll be on our way.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.780
But since I'm here,
let me say this.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.980
We're not just going to sit
down and lose to you.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.310
Rei...

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.960
Tell that to Max, too.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.470
Tell him yourself.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:45.310
Let's go.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.250
Okay.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:51.050
See ya! No holding
back tomorrow, okay?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:52.500
Wait for me!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:56.010
I would never hold back.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:26.030
After the first match of the Egyptian
stage comes the second match!

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:31.200
This hype's gonna heat up
hotter than the desert sun!

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:54.160
Rick! Where were you?

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:58.990
I told you I was going solo.

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:02.910
I don't know what's going
to happen if this keeps up.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.340
I thought about it...
But this is my only option.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:17.940
Yeah! These are the two teams that
will battle in the second match!

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:21.180
Oriental power unleashed!
Team Baihuzu!

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:26.910
Their opponents! Will they crush them with
their American power? The PPB All Starz!

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:33.340
And the stage for
their battle will be...

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.890
The Pyramid Stadium!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:43.320
Now then, it's time for the first
battle of the second match!

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:44.640
Just a moment!

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:46.800
One second, please!

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.250
What is it, Max?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.530
I'd like to request that
this be a four-man battle!

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:53.330
Wha--

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.370
--What?!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:58.170
Wow! Out of nowhere,
the PPB All Starz have

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:01.120
requested a
four-man battle!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:05.520
Max! What's the
meaning of this?!

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.360
What the hell
are you thinking?

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.600
Rick! Our souls
aren't synced up!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.740
We won't be able
to win like that!

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:15.800
We have to do this if we want
to understand each other!

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.320
What?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.180
What's going on, Rei?

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:23.910
I don't know. Max isn't the
kind of person to pull tricks.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:27.860
I thought these guys
were solo players.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.330
They should be.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.800
But our teamwork is flawless.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:33.730
Let's accept.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:34.470
Okay!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:39.010
Whoa! Baihuzu has accepted
the four-man battle!

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.440
I wonder what's going on?

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:45.610
Max's team actually
requested a four-man battle...

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:48.820
Baihuzu has the
advantage there, don't they?

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:51.490
I can't say for sure.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.680
They have plenty of
experience in four-man battles.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:12:00.780
Max's team is more powerful so they
should have the advantage in solo battles.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:05.890
I didn't think Max's team would
throw away such an advantage.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:09.760
I wonder what
Max is up to?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:14.300
Let's get this
four-man battle started!

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:20.400
Max, how long are you going to
keep mocking my battles?

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.770
I've had enough of this.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:27.630
I don't care what you try to pull.
I'm winning this on my own.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:34.320
Now! Who will be the winner
in this frantic four-man battle?

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:36.690
Egyptian stage!
Second match!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.850
Three!

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:38.940
Two!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:39.640
One!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.860
--Go, Shoot!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.920
Go, Driger!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.510
Go, Draciel!

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.310
Let's go, Galeon!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.980
Take 'em down, Rock Bison!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.250
Rick! Stay close to me!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.510
What?

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.810
I'm not letting you
hog all the glory!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.910
Don't take them
on in power!

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:09.830
Right!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.810
We need speed! We'll use our
speed to suppress their power!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:18.740
Yeah!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.560
Damn them...

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.260
Stay cool, Rick!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.510
Pay attention to
their movements!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.890
I don't want to
hear that from you!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:41.400
Even so, I can't do anything if I
don't put a stop to their moves...

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:43.090
Rick!

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:51.590
Whoa! Rock Bison has
stopped on top of the pyramid!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:56.900
It's a little dangerous, but now I
can see where they attack from.

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.510
Got him!

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.210
And here's Galeon!

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.890
Wait, Rai! It's a trap!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:04.860
What?!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.000
Too slow, black cat!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.950
Rock Bison!

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:21.450
What?!

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:24.630
NOOOO!!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:34.420
Come on, white cat.
Attack Draciel.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:37.410
You'll give me an opening
and I'll crush you both.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.230
What?!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:44.330
Did he read me?

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.040
Then I'll beat
the black cat!

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.630
Rick, no!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:51.410
What?!

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.010
Max, you little--

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:58.460
Listen to me, Rick! If you attacked,
Rei would have countered!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.430
Thanks for the save.

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:06.150
Their teamwork is
worse than I expected.

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:08.610
What are they doing?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:13.890
What's going on, Max?
Is this what you gambled your battle for?

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:17.440
Max! If you're
gonna get in my way...

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.860
Wait, Rick!
You've got the wrong idea!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:23.990
I'm taking you down first!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.340
What's happening out there?

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.330
I have no idea...

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:33.780
Rick, wait!

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.950
I'll crush anyone
who gets in my way!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:40.610
That's not it!
I was trying to save you!

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:42.000
That's a load of crap!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:43.840
No, it's not!

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:46.520
Please!
Listen to me!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:49.100
You stubborn bull!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.740
If that's what
you want, fine!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.580
I shoulda done this
a long time ago.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.590
I'm ending this, now!

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:00.960
Rick! If I win, you're
going to listen to me!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:04.290
I'd never lose to
a wimp like you!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.650
Now you've said it...

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.650
Heavy Viper Wall!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.290
An old move like that
isn't gonna work on me!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.560
Don't speak too soon.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:19.010
What is this?

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:23.560
That was a plan
just to stop you!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:27.220
Gravity Control!!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.830
Damn it!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:37.100
Drop Rock!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.160
Rai, now!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.100
Yeah!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.220
Gatling Claw!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.500
Spiral Lightning!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.850
What?!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.290
You're kidding...

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.030
No way!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:07.420
It's still up after taking
three special moves...

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.800
Stay out of my way!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.230
What's going on...?

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.290
That's a good question.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.720
What are you two doing?

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:20.530
Rei! Rai!
You two should fight, too!

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:24.010
It's a four-man battle, so
there can only be one winner!

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:24.750
Mao...

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:28.640
Why don't you just see who's the
strongest out of all four of you?

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:29.940
What are you...

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:32.020
Doesn't that sound fun?

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.220
Listen...

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.220
There's no harm in
battling like that sometimes.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:41.590
Rei, you too?

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.130
What?!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.240
What!

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:49.720
What's this?

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:50.500
Here I come!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.840
Cut it out, Rei!

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:55.830
Come on, you three!

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.970
Only one of us
is going to survive!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.570
Rei, what are you...

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:02.100
Oh, forget it!

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.760
I'm not going down
without a fight, Rei!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:09.140
That's it, Rai!
Bring it on!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.350
Okay, Rei! I accept!

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:15.430
I'll take you all down!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.440
Go!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:17.960
Go!!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.240
Goddammit!

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.260
What kind of
battle is this?

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.820
Well, you see...

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:33.470
This isn't a four-man battle!
It's just a slugfest!

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:35.170
It is, isn't it?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.170
But it looks fun!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.560
I wanna battle too!
Let me in!

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.550
No! You definitely can't!

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:46.630
You're itching for a battle, Daichi.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:47.940
Yeah!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:51.420
Indeed. That's what's at
the heart of Beyblading.

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:55.570
They've gone far beyond the concept of a
world championship or four-man battle...

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:59.580
Just a clash with all you've got.
That's what's at the heart of Beyblade!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.800
The heart...

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.180
of Beyblading...

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:13.090
These guys...

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.340
I'm at my limit.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.870
No one has
any strength left.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:22.770
Yeah.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.570
Let's finish this.

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:27.010
Be my guest.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:52.800
Who?!

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:53.950
Who's Bey is that?

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:55.210
Who won?

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.820
Damn it!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:14.450
After the final clash,
Galeon is the sole survivor!

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:17.720
Rai of Team Baihuzu wins!

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.300
I...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.600
Won...!

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:31.130
I won!!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:34.270
Rai, congratulations!

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:35.520
I won!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.540
Too bad.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.500
Who cares.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.210
Well, maybe...

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:43.360
It was sorta...

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.050
Fun, right?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:06.280
You... This is the last straw!

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:08.490
What ever do you mean?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.920
Are you really
gonna eat that?

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:17.220
Want some mayo, Rick?

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.060
Dumbass!

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.420
Keep squirting and
I'll kick your ass!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.170
Curry's so tasty when you squeeze
loads of mayonnaise on it!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.350
Time to eat!

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:31.680
I can't put
up with this!

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:58.150
One match left in
the Egyptian stage!

00:22:58.150 --> 00:23:00.070
It's our time to shine!

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:03.060
We're gonna show you a heated
battle that we just have to win!

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:04.710
You're riled up, Takao.

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:08.970
Your desire to defeat your
rivals has made you strong.

00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:13.250
But don't forget, there's another
unseen enemy for you to deal with.

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.120
You absolutely can't
lose to that, Takao.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:17.930
I can do it with
Daichi now!

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:21.150
F-Sangre! We challenge you
to a four-man battle!
